ooparts/sat is a source translation of SATCH 0.5.6rc.
Original: https://github.com/arminbiere/satch
Pinned commit: b4d4081f8971931399b36c8fdd92bdf4aabac005
Configuration: default features with NDEBUG defined (production build).
Original copyright and MIT license are preserved in LICENSE and upstream/LICENSE.
All 284 function definitions in that preprocessed library configuration are
translated, including elimination, subsumption, vivification, restart, reduction,
mode switching, and proof output. No call to a C solver is made by the Lisp code.
The Lisp representation support, public API wrappers, DIMACS frontend, translator,
and tests were added for this port. The source C frontend, debugging checker, and
alternative preprocessor configurations are retained as reference source only.
